---
import LinkPreview from '@components/ui/links/LinkPreview.astro';

const { title, subTitle1, subTitle2, src } = Astro.props;

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  subTitle1?: string;
  subTitle2?: string;
  src?: string;
}
---

<section
  class="mx-auto grid max-w-[85rem] gap-4 px-4 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:gap-12 lg:px-8"
>
  {/* Left Column: Text */}
  <div class="mt-5 md:mt-0">
    <h2
      class="block text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-800 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight dark:text-neutral-200"
    >
      OTHERS CHASE TRENDS.<br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-orange-600 dark:from-orange-300 dark:to-orange-500">WE ENGINEER MOMENTUM.</span>
    </h2>
    
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-pretty text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      At R3ACTR, we turn real-world problems into software products. We research, design, and engineer technology across AI, SaaS, Web3, and digital platforms — with a focus on building products that are genuinely useful.
    </p>
    
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      Our products reflect that approach.{' '}
      <LinkPreview
        href="https://paperlab.r3actr.work/"
        title="Paper Lab"
        description="A modern academic & research editor that brings writing, LaTeX, citations, and publication formatting into one workflow."
        image="/assets/illustrations/Thesis-bro.png"
        badge="Academic Editor"
      >
        Paper Lab
      </LinkPreview>
      {' '}is a modern academic and research editor that brings writing, LaTeX, citations, diagrams, and publication-ready formatting into one workflow.{' '}
      <LinkPreview
        href="https://www.ktuhub.site/"
        title="KTUHub"
        description="Unified academic ecosystem for KTU students with syllabus updates, question banks, and learning resources."
        image="/assets/illustrations/Studying-amico.png"
        badge="Platform"
      >
        KTUHUB
      </LinkPreview>
      {' '}is built to make academic resources and tools more accessible to students.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      We combine research, engineering, and design to transform complex problems into software that is intelligent, scalable, and simple to use.
    </p>
  </div>

  {/* Right Column: Image */}
  <div class="flex w-full justify-center order-first md:order-last mb-8 md:mb-0">
    {
      src && (
        <img
          src={src}
          alt="About R3ACTR"
          class="w-3/4 md:w-full lg:w-4/5 h-auto object-contain drop-shadow-2xl"
          draggable="false"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      )
    }
  </div>
</section>
